# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Large raw CMS claims data (~185MB across 3 files). The outpatient claims
# file alone is ~162MB, which exceeds GitHub's 100MB per-file hard limit, so
# the entire raw SynPUF folder is excluded from version control.
#
# To regenerate: download the DE-SynPUF sample files from CMS and place them
# in data/raw/synpuf/ before running etl/spark_feature_pipeline.py.
# https://www.cms.gov/data-research/statistics-trends-reports/medicare-claims-synthetic-public-use-files/de-synpuf
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/raw/synpuf/
